==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|essay|ist|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|/ˈɛ.seɪ.ɪst/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-us-essayist.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# One who [[composes]] [[essay]]s; a [[writer]] of [[short]] [[composition]]s. (compare [[short story]] [[author]]; [[novelist]]).
#: ''She was an '''essayist''' whose frequent contributions to the editorial pages of major newspapers had a loyal following.''

